*setterm* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''setterm(state)''

Sets the termios state to ''state''. Waits for pending output to drain before applying.

*Parameters:*
- ''state'': Termios state

*Returns:*
- ''ok'' on success
- ''err'' on failure or invalid state size

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if argument is not Bytes
